{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":95808,\"title\":\"Ervin Laszlo’s Legacy of a Coherent Universe\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"As a philosopher, Ervin Laszlo has spent a majority of his life digging into these mysteries. The fruits of his research reveal some startling discoveries of our untapped potential as a sapient species connected with a conscious coherent universe.\",\"posterPath\":null,\"backdropPath\":null,\"youtubeBackdrop\":\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/CPRxvt6wkrQ/maxresdefault.jpg\",\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2018,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":4,\"totalEpisodes\":19,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"Gaia\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2019-09-02\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":220717,\"name\":\"Uri Geller\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4jDVjT0tWYUN7Kkkzs0BGsSY7d6.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"CPRxvt6wkrQ\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"ogTkyd_Cwzc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"hZbbtv8Rp-0\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[],\"seasonNumber\":3,\"seasonName\":\"Season 3\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":null,\"seasonAirDate\":\"2018-12-05\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Raymond Moody’s Legacy of Near-Death Experiences - Near Death Experiences\",\"overview\":\"Dr. Raymond Moody shares his decades of research in to a place that many people call the afterlife. His results strongly suggest that there is indeed another level to existence beyond our physical realms. He reveals many of the common experiences people report when the body dies, but consciousness continues to exist. We explore experiences such as the panoramic life review, recognizing people you once knew in life, and how their lives changed when they returned to life.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-05\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Raymond Moody’s Legacy of Near-Death Experiences - Shared Death Experiences\",\"overview\":\"With NDEs and Shared Death Experiences, is it possible that no one really dies alone? Dr. Raymond Moody relays experiences people have shared as they sat with a loved one upon the threshold of death. Each has expressed that the experience has dramatically changed their lives, and doctors say that this affects the way they now treat terminal patients. Dr. Moody cautions us, that there is great difficulty in communicating the ineffability of these moments. So, he is developing a new way to think and talk about these things so that we all can better understand what transpires after the body dies.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-12\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Raymond Moody’s Legacy of Near-Death Experiences - Spirits Of Departed Loved Ones\",\"overview\":\"When someone has crossed the veil of death, how can we stay in contact? Communication with the dead may be the stuff of parlor tricks and charlatans, but Dr. Raymond Moody insists that there is legitimate scientific claim to the connections we keep with those on the other side. From dreams to mirror workings and the apparent random appearances of apparitions, he shares ways that you can create visionary encounters with the spirits of departed loved ones.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-19\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Raymond Moody’s Legacy of Near-Death Experiences - Reincarnation\",\"overview\":\"If we can believe that consciousness continues after the death of the body, what about existence through multiple lifetimes? Personal memories of reincarnation and past lives can provide powerful proof for the persistence of the soul. Dr. Raymond Moody Dr. Raymond Moody shares stories of people who have found their own connection to previous lives. The commonalities of their tales reveal a conscious process for selecting the next life. From spontaneous memories to hypnotherapeutically induced experiences, he shares ways that people have come to realize that they have lived many lives.\",\"still\":null,\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2018-12-26\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2018-09-19\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}